      range: (min: -2147483648, max: 2147483647),
    },
    // DECISION: Y splits Temperature Limit and Present Temperature into inverter and motor registers; the page gives each in 1 [°C] and the two limits 0 ~ 100, so each gets the entry shape of its X counterpart.
